      "writtenOn": "2022-09-29T14:10:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The advertiser is matched in the Scan response handlers mentioned above.\nScan requests are also filtered with the scanners address, and I prefer having both checks at the same time. \n\nIn fine, it does not make sense to match against advertisers for every kind of PDU received, so I would move all relevant checks to the specific handlers.\n\nTo give a concrete problem with this pattern:\ndirected advertising which should by your own logic be matched by one advertiser are still being reported in specific conditions even if the address is not resolved and does not match.",
